enan has been a member of the UN Council of Presidents expert panel on AGI, a fellow of the Oxford China Policy Lab, and the research manager leading IAPS\'s International Strategy team. Before joining IAPS, Renan was research manager on AI and emerging technologies at Rethink Priorities, director and cofounder of the Condor Initiative, predoctoral research fellow at the Institute for Law and AI, and a chief of staff to justices of appeal at a state court in Brazil.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,\n                                                          &quot;button&quot;: {\n                                                            &quot;buttonText&quot;: &quot;Read Bio&quot;\n                                                          },\n                                                          &quot;imageId&quot;: &quot;69d54f9cfb45041be39d22c5&quot;,\n                                                          &quot;image&quot;: {\n                                                            &quot;id&quot;: &quot;69d54f9cfb45041be39d22c5&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;recordType&quot;: 2,\n                                                            &quot;addedOn&quot;: 1775587228202,\n                                                            &quot;updatedOn&quot;: 1775587228245,\n                                                            &quot;workflowState&quot;: 1,\n                                                            &quot;publishOn&quot;: 1775587228202,\n                                                            &quot;authorId&quot;: &quot;696fbff22f7f2d6fe7ef6507&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;systemDataId&quot;: &quot;a834d9da-d62a-42c8-8c6b-10f469995557&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;systemDataVariants&quot;: &quot;1667x1667,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;: &quot;JPG&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;filename&quot;: &quot;IAPS Headshots - Jason Dixson Photography - 251020 - 203722 - 2869.jpg&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;mediaFocalPoint&quot;: {\n                                                              &quot;x&quot;: 0.5,\n                                                              &quot;y&quot;: 0.5,\n                                                              &quot;source&quot;: 3\n                                                            },\n                                                            &quot;colorData&quot;: {\n                                                              &quot;topLeftAverage&quot;: &quot;d2d5e4&quot;,\n                                                              &quot;topRightAverage&quot;: &quot;dddfeb&quot;,\n                                                              &quot;bottomLeftAverage&quot;: &quot;e5e9f2&quot;,\n                                                              &quot;bottomRightAverage&quot;: &quot;e4e7ed&quot;,\n                                                              &quot;centerAverage&quot;: &quot;5e4842&quot;,\n                                                              &quot;suggestedBgColor&quot;: &quot;a6a6af&quot;\n                                                            },\n                                                            &quot;urlId&quot;: &quot;7xh6gzmrx5ai9m47wlxdh05zsqo33q&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;title&quot;: &quot;&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;body&quot;: null,\n                                                            &quot;likeCount&quot;: 0,\n                                                            &quot;commentCount&quot;: 0,\n                                                            &quot;publicComme