nd global tech governance landscapes, align R&amp;amp;D efforts with national security priorities, and enhance policymakers’ understanding of emerging technologies. Cara previously served as an Editorial Associate at the Council on Foreign Relations, a Fulbright Scholar in Bogota, Colombia, and an intern with the U.S. Department of State, USAID, the United Nations Secretariat, and the European Union External Action Service.&lt;\\/p&gt;&quot;,\n                                                          &quot;button&quot;: {\n                                                            &quot;buttonText&quot;: &quot;Read Bio&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;buttonLink&quot;: &quot;&quot;\n                                                          },\n                                                          &quot;imageId&quot;: &quot;69d54feb5bee8b5a97ecab05&quot;,\n                                                          &quot;image&quot;: {\n                                                            &quot;id&quot;: &quot;69d54feb5bee8b5a97ecab05&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;recordType&quot;: 2,\n                                                            &quot;addedOn&quot;: 1775587307619,\n                                                            &quot;updatedOn&quot;: 1775587307656,\n                                                            &quot;workflowState&quot;: 1,\n                                                            &quot;publishOn&quot;: 1775587307619,\n                                                            &quot;authorId&quot;: &quot;696fbff22f7f2d6fe7ef6507&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;systemDataId&quot;: &quot;44591de3-f756-4735-9fb8-d1f09930b6b1&quot;,\n                                                            &quot;systemDataVariants&quot;: &quot;5472x3648,100w,300w,500w,750w,1000w,1500w,2500w&quot;,\n     