text-secondary-light">Careers</div></div></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><h1 class="hero-text" data-w-id="56f063dd-9762-1352-ebec-0a82ff432913">Making AI Safe to Ship</h1><div class="padding-sm"></div><p class="text-primary text-size-lg" data-w-id="56f063dd-9762-1352-ebec-0a82ff432916">Real stakes. Real-world impact.</p><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="button-wrapper portrait-full"><a class="button is-primary-brand w-inline-block" href="#open-positions"><div>View Open Positions</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Model Metrics</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Pricing</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper negative-margin hide" data-w-id="56f063dd-9762-1352-ebec-0a82ff432923"><a class="text-link-background w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white text-size-md">AI\xa0security\xa0products</div></a><a class="text-link-background w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white text-size-md">View case studies</div></a></div></div></div></div><section class="hero-on-load"><div class="background-video w-background-video w-background-video-atom" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-poster-url="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_poster.0000000.jpg" data-video-urls="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_mp4.mp4,https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_webm.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"><video autoplay="" data-object-fit="cover" data-wf-ignore="true" id="56f063dd-9762-1352-ebec-0a82ff43292b-video" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" style=\'background-image:url("https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_poster.0000000.jpg")\'><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_mp4.mp4"/><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_webm.webm"/></video></div></section><div class="background-fill overlay"></div></section><section class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5a3-d72d58a1"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium">The Hardest Problems Emerge at the Edge of AI</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>The most interesting, and messiest, problems show up at the edges.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="padding-md hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="padding-lg hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left"></div><p>Gray Swan has made a habit of being first in line. We’re often the first to spot new failure modes, and, by extension, the first to defend against them. Being research-first isn’t a tagline. It’s how we build our products, our playbooks, and our culture of thinking three steps ahead.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>Whether it’s stress-testing the latest agentic AI in a lab or helping enterprises deploy at full speed, our goal is the same: uncover the hard problems before anyone else does, then turn that insight into real-world solutions that let innovation happen, safely and without slowing down.</p></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="border-left"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper hide-tablet"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="border-left"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="border-left"></div></div></div></div><div class="border-default"></div></div></section><section id="model-cards"><section id="model-cards"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Trusted at the Frontier</h2><p>Our research has directly informed the safety evaluations of some of the most advanced AI models in the world.</p></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="model-list-wrapper"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="collection-list featured w-dyn-items" featured="" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="card horizontall---2" data-featured="true"><div class="featured-model-wrapper v2"><h3 class="tag">New Release</h3><div class="div-block-95"><img alt="" class="model-logo padding-bottom" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/69e7d85f21121d47a3a2e058_Anthropic_logo.svg" width="124"/></div><div class="model-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-xs">Claude Mythos Preview</h3></div></div><div class="button-wrapper align-center"><a class="button is-primary-brand w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.sanity.io/files/4zrzovbb/website/7624816413e9b4d2e3ba620c5a5e091b98b190a5.pdf" target="_blank"><div class="text-block-10">View System Card</div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="collection-list _4-up-grid model-list-overflow w-dyn-items" featured="" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="card smaller" data-featured="false"><div class="model-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/69e7d85f21121d47a3a2e058_Anthropic_logo.svg" width="124"/></div><h3 class="heading-xs align-center justify-center">Claude Opus 4.7</h3><a class="button is-secondary-dark is-small w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.sanity.io/files/4zrzovbb/website/037f06850df7fbe871e206dad004c3db5fd50340.pdf" target="_blank"><div class="text-size-sm">View System Card</div><img al