/policy with meaningful but not primary x-risk component (congressional AI policy, Brookings AI security, major think tanks with AI safety programs)\n- 3-4: General AI ethics or tech policy with some safety relevance but no clear x-risk focus\n- 1-2: Tangential — broad tech/data policy that mentions AI without safety focus, or compliance roles'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
